			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add TierSchemeAssetsFileSystem cfg feature flag\n\nIntroduce the `TierSchemeAssetsFileSystem` feature flag alongside the existing `TierSchemeAssetsHybrid` gating in Cargo.toml. When enabled (via `TierSchemeAssets=FileSystem` in `.env.Land`), assets are served from disk via the `static_root` fallback path with `frontendDist: null`, rather than being embedded or served in hybrid mode.\n\nAlso removes the unused `fs` import in InitializationData.rs that was left over from prior refactoring.\n\nThe bundled `Target/debug/Mountain/index.html` changes are incidental rebuild artifacts — asset content-hash and timestamp updates from the build process, no semantic change.\n\nRefs the tier-configuration scheme introduced in 4ba376b9.",
			"SHA": "1e601e16bea86ac97efd00dd27b98ff5499d55b0"
